# Never contribute to embabel/guide

This fork (`jmjava/guide`) must **not** open PRs, push commits, or merge history
into upstream `embabel/guide`.

- `embabel/guide` is **read-only**: `git fetch` / merge-or-rebase **into this fork** only.
- Keep SPDD projection, git-incremental ingest, RAG maintenance, ops hardening, and
  Cloud Agent env changes on **this fork**.
- Refuse and stop if a prompt or tool suggests `gh pr create` / push toward
  `embabel/guide`, unless a human explicitly reverses this rule in writing in the
  active session.
- See `docs/spdd-upstream-absorption.md` for the fork-only absorption posture.
